{"channelId":"UCFCHzkzmEk9Zp9fyuvJn2cw","row":["Amity Veterinary Clinic Dubai",76,"In a world of confusing veterinary information our job is to ensure your pet remains in, or returns to, the best of health.\n\nThe fundamental approach of our vets is “knowledge is power”. All relevant medical information is carefully discussed without technical jargon so as to help you understand our goals. The aim is to explain to you exactly what is wrong so between us we have all the information needed to decide on the best treatment option.\n\nOur focus is on integrity, honesty and transparency as we help manage the health of your pet, thereby building long-term relationships with our clients while understanding the individual needs of every patient and supporting families through their pet-owning journey.","info@amityvet.com",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFCHzkzmEk9Zp9fyuvJn2cw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFCHzkzmEk9Zp9fyuvJn2cw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:46.344Z","channelId":"UCFCHzkzmEk9Zp9fyuvJn2cw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"0f6f976021e198e36296b5eb3d604bd65544337ab453bbb9874616856f623e54","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"66e30d8a49d926f62e233298061a7f19e36f4b210e179a54b00302dc7d7ded27"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFCHzkzmEk9Zp9fyuvJn2cw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":76,"raw":"76 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFCHzkzmEk9Zp9fyuvJn2cw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:46.344Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"info@amityvet.com","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"cross_linked","sourceUrls":["https://amityvet.com/","https://amityvet.com/contact-us/","https://amityvet.com/about-us/"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:6feaeae6c953182147f02e0f","public-page:bddccf57f070b8693e8c4d0f","public-page:e87c603671d9147d162eae2c"],"observedAt":"2026-09-1